stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: request or invitation awaiting approval
  [*] --> active: direct grant, baseline, entitlement
  pending --> active: approved or email confirmed
  active --> suspended: suspend!(reason)
  suspended --> active: reinstate!
  active --> ended: end!(reason), or ends_at passes
  suspended --> ended: end!(reason)
  ended --> [*]: kept as history
  note right of ended
    The unique key ignores ended rows,
    so the same role can be granted again.
    Every change writes a membership event.
  end note
